e deviant  we can actually see the deviant get back  up and start snapping at people but  makari is moving them out of the way and  getting them far away from danger  meanwhile kamil nanjiani's kingo comes  and starts to help in the battle we see  him harness cosmic energy and use it as  projectile blast kind of shooting it out  of his fingertips like their guns it  hits the deviant back a little bit and  then makari comes in and hits it with  the force of her super speed which  knocks it back then we see kingo  harnessing the cosmic energy in a  different way it doesn't just come out  of his fingertips he kind of focuses it  into a ball between his hands and he  kind of does a little kamehameha and  shoots it at the deviant this shows his  mastery of cosmic energy being able to  use it as projectile blast then after  ghost signs to makari nice move in which  she signs back you too and if you  haven't caught on by now makari the  character is actually deaf and she's  actually being played by a deaf actress  lauren ridloff so it's pretty awesome to  see now the nice move thing is really  cool to see how close the eternals are  but i also think that this could be  because they haven't actually fought in  a very long time if they truly were  asleep before arriving to earth who  knows how long they could have been  asleep for they could have been asleep  and sort of just sitting there until the  celestials decided that it was time to  use them clearly they knew each other  before because they are able to sign to  each other so it makes you really wonder  about their backstory which of course  the movie is going to go into now we  also do have new clips of athena in  action  of course played by the wonderful  angelina jolie thena is the warrior of  the group she harnesses her cosmic  energy into weapons now in the trailers  and the clips that we've seen so far  we've actually seen her turn her cosmic  energy into several different weapons  we've seen a spear a sword an axe we've  also seen her dual wield dagger type  weapons and we've actually seen her use  two different types of weapons at once a  few times during all of these clips and  trailers now we recently learned from  marvel a little bit about angelina  jolie's character athena as it turns out  she's going to have somewhat of a  disability in the movie according to  marvel producer nate moore she's going  to have something called mod warai and  i'm sure i didn't pronounce that right  but basically it's described as a  version of dementia he said in an  interview with screenrant she has a  tragic story in our film in that she  comes down with something called mod  would rai if you guys are fans of comics  mod would rai is something that can be  set an internal it's a version of  dementia because of the amount of  memories they have they become unstuck  in their own mind so she starts to  forget exactly when she is so through  the course of the movie gilgamesh  becomes a protector and when we find  them in the modern day they're living  off the grid in a cabin in australia  because she's too dangerous to have  around humans so it's a fun arc for  angelina to play this is actually pretty  revealing about her character now in the  comics sprite using his power in the  comics because in the comics spread as a  guy makes all of the eternals forget who  they are takes away their powers and  removes all records of them from reality  now obviously the eternals have lived  for 7 000 years they say that in the  comics and obviously that is a lot of  memories to kind of keep inside of your  mind so yes reality could get rather  confusing if you had a lot of memories  to store however we know that thena  actually has a pretty big secret and in  the comics her big secret is that she  actually has a kid or twins with a  deviant and guess who that deviant was  crow the very same person that we see in  the trailers talking to athena so i'm  guessing that the secret of theena is  that she a